    ],
    "text_sha256": "1d81b668367c5166517f08183920a0f495820d4521de79e2b77dff53614bec27"
  },
  "card_fields": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "name": "硬节点",
      "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR34湘云/若兰关联但O06终局开放；R41妙玉“欲洁未洁、终陷淖泥”方向，瓜州具体遭遇不锁；R33惜春为尼。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1086,
          1088
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          43034,
          43195
        ],
        "text_sha256": "51e0f8952a21bb0a8094a1fcaba0d209642709bf4ef8e896ccf40002c09f9f27"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "name": "最强处 / P-Lock",
      "text": "**2｜最强处 / P-Lock**  \n湘云两副箸改单份、修瓦付工钱；妙玉米油水香灰与茶具冲突；惜春旧画袋/旧笔、抄经、废纸翻面、黄纸、灯油；梳子“忘了扔”与“谁同你说我件件想得明白？”；结尾裁黄纸。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1089,
          1091
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          43195,
          43464
        ],
        "text_sha256": "cacb62ca388065258bdbfeb52a0e5df5564bc5176eab203360676653ef29b531"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "name": "最薄处",
      "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n当前三大块仍略像“三个结局说明”；需改成交叉互照，但不能使三人同义。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1092,
          1094
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          43464,
          43588
        ],
        "text_sha256": "11777bf5d02cd7d980fb5067000917be0adb8b30743da166b50623d2fc95227b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n用“饭—衣—纸”三母题交叉：湘云饭/若兰衣/信；妙玉粥/灰衣/经卷；惜春择菜/退衣/黄纸。湘云缺席丈夫如何变成房租、瓦钱、工钱；妙玉洁癖怎样受劳务制约；惜春先显示已住久。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1095,
          1097
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          43588,
          43856
        ],
        "text_sha256": "9e79533523458f3e4a1dec8ed3ebffe7114fc4a0add892698bc56dca54cb7b53"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n湘云一线房东/邻妇/瓦匠/送信人；妙玉一线老尼/小徒/香客/厨房；惜春一线师父/同住者/宝玉。\n\n**D2边界｜** 97虽有尼庵，贾芸并无独立来访动机；不得拿本回“庵”字去倒填W2“仗义探庵”。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1098,
          1102
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          43856,
          44127
        ],
        "text_sha256": "c624e58bf144ed77055468f3aec7fa06618e160d700ce76de944a600fa7ed85b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n97文化动作已充分，保护不增：不找“终极大观园残图”，不加名茶名器、高僧书法。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1103,
          1105
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          44127,
          44259
        ],
        "text_sha256": "45bde41bfe1fa89c358331a06c0b9bc95ef15c92ca55a6ee28357b58a628ca3f"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "诗文身份",
      "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \n湘云无完整新诗；妙玉无偈；惜春无偈/终极画跋。实用书写即足。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1106,
          1108
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          44259,
          44372
        ],
        "text_sha256": "0045c275f11629e1d3f0e544127a45f38796d5890cd5ff5df3c51fad60ebb210"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "name": "笑料",
      "text": "**8｜笑料**  \n湘云饭咸淡、三片瓦要不要等人；宝玉挡光、伞带了别白拿等保留。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1109,
          1111
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          44372,
          44481
        ],
        "text_sha256": "63a01aced52d458cfecf42adc259bdca8b2adfd8b35d1d8d982ee0ecdf7a72fd"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "name": "宗教/梦",
      "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n41最高重点：妙玉=洁与尘，不“终于悟”；惜春=断与冷，不“件件想明白”。湘云门栓错听只作梦阈，不升级若兰托梦。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1112,
          1114
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          44481,
          44664
        ],
        "text_sha256": "400c9af47afb8926552ec4466ca0f9fa863bc4d6788b2b2a86b3e8aa09db4183"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n瓦匠、房东、庵中佛事/香火、抄经与厨房劳动形成三套社会基础设施。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1115,
          1117
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          44664,
          44778
        ],
        "text_sha256": "cfe93e1ac33f8a8333a227489f88d1f784d26090ecd6a09e5edfe618f5dccc43"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "name": "四链",
      "text": "**11｜四链**  \n湘云：钱是修瓦/房钱/工钱；妙玉：米油/香火/佛事所得；惜春：灯油、纸、份饭。三线经济必须不同。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1118,
          1120
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          44778,
          44934
        ],
        "text_sha256": "aa79c3495bd389fb23dd681e2c79303b8cfaacf632f7a3eb69174e55e136ff82"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "name": "必须保留",
      "text": "**12｜必须保留**  \n双箸、若兰旧衣/金麒麟；妙玉洗盏盆/香灰/灰衣；惜春梳子、空字不猜、黄纸、菜、灯油。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1121,
          1123
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          44934,
          45080
        ],
        "text_sha256": "8c99583f0b1518febad2a02925b6cce6e60a74e8c7608dbdf88d2535546d4044"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n“三人都看破了”的作者句；妙玉佛偈；惜春悟道宣言；湘云望夫诗/梦。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1124,
          1126
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          45080,
          45197
        ],
        "text_sha256": "de902b88f3f91947d35faf70b46c31da966dbde1a065d9f108f2f060d2a27c09"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3",
      "text": "**14｜L3**  \n必须L3交叉编排，是压力测试重点。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1127,
          1129
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          45197,
          45260
        ],
        "text_sha256": "76a204f731540d83dcbc76c36db12c85d9a3d73b08dde2cb135ca037a9c9fbae"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "name": "前80同构",
      "text": "**15｜前80同构**  \n41妙玉茶品的“洁”与97庵务反照；74惜春断尤氏、园画任务与97断/抄经反照；湘云前80群体诗酒与97个人小户管理反照。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          1130,
          1132
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          45260,
          45442
        ],
        "text_sha256": "31646c7664c0bc59fe456b5ebb6b98acdc34489c9034497daf1c54bd4d30a800"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "name": "回前诗",
      "text": "**16｜回前诗** 无。  \n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
